# Vision + honesty (always)

Read `@docs/vision.md` before shipping product, copy, metrics, or social.

## Must

- Do the right thing: honest status, dated evidence, no fake scale.
- Make useful stuff: free plans and clear next steps for any age / any size idea.
- Dual brand: Lab = usefulness · DTRTC = entertainment. Same founder, separate surfaces.
- Agent is 1st chair ops; Ian is 2nd chair override/unlock (`@docs/company-operating-system.md`).

## Never

- Fake Fortune / top-50 / headcount / client theater
- Live store, open raise, or hiring pipelines that do not exist
- Reverse-engineering third-party apps as growth strategy
- Committing secrets or recovery codes

## When writing for customers or social

Prefer templates in `@docs/templates/` over generic AI marketing voice.
